WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.490
- So Doctor Simone Gold,
who is perhaps most famous

00:00:02.490 --> 00:00:05.160
for participating in
the January 6th riots,

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:07.010
tells Mike Lindell that she's forming

00:00:07.010 --> 00:00:10.590
the Legal Eagle Dream
Team to end all lockdowns

00:00:10.590 --> 00:00:13.290
and the emergency use authorizations.

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:14.600
- And the Legal Eagle Dream Team consists

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:17.150
of warrior attorneys who
plan to bring lawsuits,

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:18.300
really across the country.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:20.550
- Thanks to Patriot Takes
for the heads up on this one.

00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:21.610
Now, first of all,

00:00:21.610 --> 00:00:25.640
regarding her forming the
Legal Eagle Dream Team, rude.

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:28.320
And second of all, this
is not going to work.

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:32.400
There's a long line of cases
that basically allow states

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:33.233
and the federal government

00:00:33.233 --> 00:00:36.880
to engage in lockdowns
related to pandemics.

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:38.210
It goes back hundreds of years

00:00:38.210 --> 00:00:39.480
to the founding of our country.

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:41.140
We've covered this a lot on this channel.

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:44.372
But efforts to claim that
these laws are illegal,

00:00:44.372 --> 00:00:47.650
they rarely work, and I
don't think this effort

00:00:47.650 --> 00:00:49.370
is going to work either.

00:00:49.370 --> 00:00:51.460
Now, whether I should sue
for trademark infringement,

00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:53.210
well, that's another matter entirely.

00:00:53.210 --> 00:00:55.153
So I might see her in court.

